WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:04.160
O light of pure sky, do as I command!

00:06.290 --> 00:08.350
Shine over the darkness!

00:08.630 --> 00:11.030
Go! Priestesses!

00:11.030 --> 00:12.320
No!

00:11.340 --> 00:14.030
Perform the Dance of Exorcism!

00:28.810 --> 00:31.870
You girls really are the best pair.

00:31.870 --> 00:37.010
It was fated for you two to meet.

00:50.230 --> 00:52.780
kimi to ireba

00:50.230 --> 00:52.780
If I’m with you -

00:52.780 --> 00:55.610
kimi to itara

00:52.780 --> 00:55.610
because I’m with you -

00:55.610 --> 01:00.240
kokoro ga yasuraku

00:55.610 --> 01:00.240
my heart is at ease.

01:01.200 --> 01:03.790
kimi mo soude

01:01.200 --> 01:03.790
Surely, you’re the same.

01:03.790 --> 01:09.340
kimi mo ima yasurakerute

01:03.790 --> 01:09.340
You’re at ease now, too.

01:10.380 --> 01:16.970
itekuretara ii noni

01:10.380 --> 01:16.970
If you can just admit it,

01:18.720 --> 01:22.310
sono mama

01:18.720 --> 01:22.310
for even time to forget us,

01:23.220 --> 01:36.450
jikan saemo wasuresouna kurai shizen dakara

01:23.220 --> 01:36.450
it’s only natural, at this rate.

01:37.200 --> 01:47.920
yubisaki kara koboreochiru violet wo yo

01:37.200 --> 01:47.920
Violet drops, falling slowly from our fingertips…

01:47.920 --> 01:54.800
chiisana yume egaite yukou

01:47.920 --> 01:54.800
“Let us follow that small dream with a smile!”

01:54.800 --> 02:00.720
futaride sasayaka na

01:54.800 --> 02:00.720
And just like that, we are happy

02:02.140 --> 02:06.350
kotoba ga ureshii

02:02.140 --> 02:06.350
over such trifling words

02:06.850 --> 02:11.060
somatteku sora

02:06.850 --> 02:11.060
that paint the sky.

02:31.240 --> 02:36.260
I dreamed so clearly about the day I wanted to forget.

02:39.690 --> 02:41.250
I want to die.

02:41.140 --> 02:44.060
Approaching Heart

02:45.790 --> 02:47.100
So hot...

02:56.850 --> 02:57.650
Here.

03:20.820 --> 03:21.840
’Morning.

03:21.840 --> 03:23.600
Good morning.

03:28.210 --> 03:30.020
Why are <i>you</i> here?!

03:30.930 --> 03:33.890
And Mom isn’t surprised at all.

03:35.920 --> 03:40.250
I am afraid this incident was also caused by Sedona’s subordinates.

03:40.250 --> 03:42.320
Answer my question!

03:42.880 --> 03:46.280
One’s inner darkness is lured out by Sedona.

03:46.280 --> 03:48.670
Be careful, Priestess of the Sky.

03:48.670 --> 03:50.190
Who the heck is a Priestess?

03:50.190 --> 03:51.130
Kanon?

03:51.980 --> 03:54.430
You must listen to Matsumoto-san

03:54.430 --> 03:57.340
and be a successful Priestess in the future.

03:58.460 --> 04:03.680
As the new Priestess of the Sky, you must awaken as soon as possible.

04:03.680 --> 04:05.130
Aww, man.

04:05.130 --> 04:08.370
Why is there always trouble surrounding me?

04:08.370 --> 04:10.180
Trouble?

04:10.180 --> 04:14.250
Ever since her childhood, trouble’s always been around her.

04:14.250 --> 04:16.700
During summer break, she had to help feed the sheep.

04:16.700 --> 04:18.620
Feeding sheep is better than this.

04:18.620 --> 04:21.550
Don’t compare being a Priestess to feeding sheep!

04:21.550 --> 04:25.820
Both of your Priestesses must be able to work together at any time.

04:25.820 --> 04:29.320
You must combine your power to defeat Sedona!

04:33.850 --> 04:37.980
It seems that 100% purity is the future goal.

04:37.980 --> 04:40.130
This is such a tiring job.

04:40.130 --> 04:42.410
I am very evil, after all,

04:42.410 --> 04:44.590
so I’m sure I can’t get to 100% purity.

04:44.860 --> 04:47.050
Plus, I have to get ready for the entrance exams.

04:47.050 --> 04:48.960
No time to be a Priestess.

04:48.960 --> 04:51.570
No time to be a fortuneteller, either.

04:51.570 --> 04:53.400
It’s your turn today.

04:53.400 --> 04:55.020
I <i>will</i> work.

04:55.020 --> 04:57.120
That’s not what I meant.

04:57.120 --> 04:59.290
You really want to go to college?

04:59.290 --> 05:00.270
Yes, I do!

05:00.910 --> 05:02.700
You open the window and see the ocean.

05:02.700 --> 05:04.770
The ocean breeze blows my hair.

05:04.770 --> 05:06.990
There’s bamboo and poisonous snakes all over.

05:06.990 --> 05:08.760
The sounds of the waves and sea breeze...

05:08.760 --> 05:10.540
Natural sunlight everywhere...

05:10.540 --> 05:11.910
I can’t stand it anymore!

05:12.170 --> 05:14.720
I have to leave this island and go to the city,

05:14.720 --> 05:18.080
to a modern college, and live a happy campus life.

05:20.060 --> 05:21.540
Simple.

05:21.540 --> 05:23.510
Normal.

05:23.980 --> 05:27.340
I want to go to a new world.

05:27.750 --> 05:29.790
A new world...

05:29.790 --> 05:33.310
Well, we’ll have to do something about those feelings.

05:33.950 --> 05:40.070
Ever since she was a child, she always had that evil aura, and she feels down easily.

05:40.070 --> 05:43.170
I’ll leave it to you, Matsumoto-san.

05:43.170 --> 05:45.400
That’s why she threw away the ring.

05:45.400 --> 05:47.070
What ring?

05:47.070 --> 05:49.370
The ring from her ex-boyfriend.

05:49.900 --> 05:51.590
Ex-boyfriend?

05:53.530 --> 05:55.320
So that’s what happened.

05:55.780 --> 05:58.800
Really, who cares?

05:58.800 --> 06:01.250
Oh, she got dumped.

06:01.250 --> 06:04.070
It was unsuccessful.

06:04.070 --> 06:07.730
Her recent bout of evilness is due to that.

06:08.420 --> 06:14.320
I never thought a Priestess who would have to defeat Sedona would have such an evil aura.

06:17.900 --> 06:19.620
The sound of water?

06:22.300 --> 06:23.940
Do you both need to take a bath?

06:24.700 --> 06:26.360
Bath?

06:33.070 --> 06:35.370
There’s a mini ocean inside the house!

06:35.370 --> 06:36.490
It’s real!

06:40.500 --> 06:42.700
This ocean sure is warm!

06:46.630 --> 06:48.900
It feels good!

06:48.900 --> 06:50.800
What a relief...

06:50.800 --> 06:56.060
Wait, can’t I even take a relaxing bath?

06:57.360 --> 07:00.370
Kanon’s head is so full.

07:00.370 --> 07:02.420
Bubbly head!

07:02.420 --> 07:03.610
Bubbly...

07:03.610 --> 07:07.170
This is how you wash your hair!

07:10.860 --> 07:16.990
Bubbly!

07:33.160 --> 07:35.080
Onee-chan, it’s so pretty!

07:45.850 --> 07:47.600
A missed call?

07:48.070 --> 07:48.940
Who was it?

07:52.060 --> 07:53.280
Suzuki.

07:58.570 --> 07:59.030
Yes?

07:59.370 --> 08:00.680
It’s Suzuki.

08:01.240 --> 08:03.030
I called you just now.

08:03.030 --> 08:04.250
I saw.

08:04.250 --> 08:05.700
Where are you?

08:05.700 --> 08:06.780
At home.

08:06.780 --> 08:10.400
Didn’t we agree? Today is the gathering for the class’s girls.

08:10.400 --> 08:12.320
I never said that I’d go.

08:12.320 --> 08:13.700
Everyone is here.

08:13.700 --> 08:15.480
What’s the gathering for?

08:15.480 --> 08:17.370
Drinking and doing karaoke together.

08:17.370 --> 08:19.890
I still have to study and go to work.

08:19.890 --> 08:21.340
I don’t have time for that.

08:21.340 --> 08:22.770
I have to go.

08:22.770 --> 08:23.420
Bye.

08:23.420 --> 08:23.730
Miya-

08:29.510 --> 08:32.670
If you die by some unfortunate accident, leave me your shell.

08:33.610 --> 08:35.030
Um...

08:35.370 --> 08:36.490
Oh!

08:36.880 --> 08:39.560
I tried it on. How is it?

08:40.300 --> 08:43.190
Kanon’s size is just right for you.

08:43.190 --> 08:44.620
It’s really, really cute!

08:47.370 --> 08:48.550
Onee-chan!

08:48.550 --> 08:49.560
Urin!

08:52.390 --> 08:54.970
Urin is so cute!

08:54.970 --> 08:55.740
Does it look good?

08:55.740 --> 08:56.750
It really does!

08:56.750 --> 08:57.890
I’m heading out.

08:58.340 --> 08:59.790
Have a good day.

08:59.790 --> 09:01.470
Kanon, I’m going, too!

09:01.850 --> 09:02.890
Me too, Onee-chan!

09:03.150 --> 09:04.490
Me, too!

09:07.760 --> 09:11.630
This shell sure fits for being the Turtle Shell Fortuneteller.

09:11.630 --> 09:14.740
Mi-Mi-Miyako-san!

09:16.130 --> 09:18.700
Fortunetelling here!

09:18.700 --> 09:20.620
Make discomfort leave! Bring good luck!

09:18.700 --> 09:21.130
This fortunetelling is very accurate!

09:21.130 --> 09:23.570
Come and have your fortune told!

09:23.570 --> 09:25.410
Why do I have to do something like this?

09:25.410 --> 09:26.850
The money for the roasted barley tea a while ago.

09:27.860 --> 09:29.790
Plus that dress’s rental fee.

09:29.790 --> 09:31.550
For shelter and food,

09:32.920 --> 09:34.540
you need money.

09:34.540 --> 09:37.630
Make-up exams and signing up for college...

09:37.630 --> 09:40.530
If you don’t have enough, go and catch poisonous snakes.

09:41.550 --> 09:43.430
Poisonous snakes? Kanon-chan?

09:43.830 --> 09:47.590
The community institute buys live ones.

09:47.590 --> 09:50.840
Won’t you die if you get bitten?

09:50.840 --> 09:52.650
Yes.

09:54.030 --> 09:57.890
The future is a bet on life!

09:59.710 --> 10:01.350
I’m sorry!

10:02.080 --> 10:04.370
I don’t want to die!

10:06.890 --> 10:10.040
You want to go to college?

10:10.040 --> 10:10.960
Of course.

10:10.960 --> 10:14.760
When I picked up the ring,

10:15.200 --> 10:19.410
I thought that I wanted to go to the Sky.

10:19.410 --> 10:23.010
I’d never been to the new world.

10:24.110 --> 10:27.540
You’re talking about me going to college?

10:27.540 --> 10:29.720
You want to go, right?

10:30.390 --> 10:32.460
I won’t be a Priestess.

10:41.120 --> 10:42.370
Su-Suzuki!

10:42.890 --> 10:44.360
Tell her I’m not here!

10:44.360 --> 10:45.090
Why?

10:45.090 --> 10:46.670
That girl is super annoying!

10:46.670 --> 10:47.360
Annoying?

10:47.360 --> 10:48.290
I’m counting on you!

10:48.550 --> 10:49.940
Kanon-chan...

10:49.940 --> 10:51.260
Uh...

10:51.260 --> 10:53.030
Hm?

10:53.030 --> 10:54.710
Is Miyamori here?

10:55.090 --> 10:56.440
Miyamori?

10:56.440 --> 10:57.760
Miyamori Kanon.

10:57.760 --> 11:01.590
Kanon-chan, she... uh... um...

11:05.980 --> 11:07.170
Here.

11:11.890 --> 11:14.380
Welcome. I am Marin.

11:14.380 --> 11:16.490
This is my first time fortunetelling.

11:16.490 --> 11:17.940
Uh...

11:17.940 --> 11:19.880
I don’t really....

11:19.880 --> 11:21.690
Miss Annoying, right?

11:22.810 --> 11:24.750
What do you want to know?

11:24.750 --> 11:30.040
Whatever it is, this crystal ball will tell me... I think.

11:30.040 --> 11:33.250
What is your relationship with Miyamori?

11:34.360 --> 11:35.710
We’re friends.

11:36.070 --> 11:37.630
Friends?

11:37.630 --> 11:38.990
Since when?

11:38.990 --> 11:40.360
Yesterday.

11:40.360 --> 11:42.880
Oh, is that so.

11:42.880 --> 11:46.140
I answered it myself instead of asking the crystal ball.

11:47.380 --> 11:49.810
Are you Kanon-chan’s friend, too?

11:51.730 --> 11:53.590
Uh, I guess so.

11:53.590 --> 11:55.940
What is she doing?

11:55.940 --> 11:58.150
Hurry up and make her leave!

11:58.390 --> 12:01.150
Well, I have known her since we were little.

12:01.150 --> 12:06.210
Wow! I want to hear some stories from Kanon-chan’s childhood!

12:06.210 --> 12:07.490
Wanna use this?

12:07.490 --> 12:09.530
Oh, uh, that’s all right.

12:09.530 --> 12:13.160
That’s right, huh? This isn’t fortunetelling.

12:10.540 --> 12:15.960
I don't get her train of thought...

12:17.990 --> 12:26.360
During kindergarten, we had to act together at a party.

12:26.360 --> 12:30.600
There was one role no one wanted to play: the evil tree.

12:31.770 --> 12:34.230
Miyamori Kanon (Age 4)

12:32.450 --> 12:34.230
I’ll play the role!

12:34.670 --> 12:41.170
That day, Miyamori, acting as the evil tree, was really scary.

12:40.650 --> 12:43.610
Kanon

12:43.610 --> 12:47.120
Everyone thought they would be captured.

12:47.120 --> 12:51.240
Since then, everyone’s been scared of Miyamori.

12:52.500 --> 12:55.170
Suzuki

12:52.950 --> 12:55.170
Kanon-chan is so scary...

12:57.470 --> 13:01.550
Miyamori seemed to have an evil aura at that time.

13:02.340 --> 13:05.400
But after that, I understood.

13:05.400 --> 13:11.180
She does the things other people won’t do.

13:11.570 --> 13:16.730
During hide-and-seek, Miyamori is always "it".

13:16.730 --> 13:18.670
Even after elementary school,

13:18.670 --> 13:21.710
whether she was cleaning the toilet or feeding the sheep,

13:21.710 --> 13:23.700
the evil aura was always there.

13:23.700 --> 13:25.740
The jobs got done nicely, though.

13:28.630 --> 13:35.990
I guess Miyamori doesn’t like arguing or seeing others’ tension.

13:35.990 --> 13:41.080
Because of her, everyone managed to avoid fighting.

13:42.630 --> 13:44.890
Kanon-chan is so kind.

13:49.760 --> 13:54.020
Well, anyway, I just came to see her since I heard her boyfriend dumped her.

13:54.020 --> 13:55.830
Ah! Boyfriend-san?

13:57.070 --> 14:00.190
If you’re here, I think Miyamori will be fine.

14:01.320 --> 14:02.730
See ya.

14:09.600 --> 14:11.160
Hey, Kanon-chan.

14:11.500 --> 14:12.520
That girl...

14:12.520 --> 14:13.350
Suzuki.

14:13.350 --> 14:14.430
Perch?!

14:14.430 --> 14:15.990
She’s not some kind of fish.

14:15.990 --> 14:17.100
Huh?

14:17.100 --> 14:20.750
I think Suzuki-chan wants to be friends with you.

14:22.120 --> 14:23.710
Impossible.

14:23.710 --> 14:25.600
Why?

14:25.600 --> 14:27.930
I am not fit for making friends.

14:27.930 --> 14:31.090
When everyone looks at me, they get scared.

14:31.360 --> 14:33.570
Why do they get scared?

14:33.570 --> 14:36.290
You have such pretty eyes.

14:37.430 --> 14:39.200
Just as that turtle said,

14:39.200 --> 14:42.570
my evil aura surrounds me.

14:42.570 --> 14:44.340
It has since I was a kid.

14:44.340 --> 14:46.010
That can’t be right.

14:46.010 --> 14:47.200
It is.

14:47.200 --> 14:51.880
Therefore, everyone - even my friends - will hate me and leave me.

14:52.510 --> 14:53.520
Kanon-chan!

14:54.090 --> 14:55.990
I will not leave.

14:56.650 --> 14:59.960
Kanon-chan and I will be friends forever.

15:05.210 --> 15:06.850
You’ll turn out to be the same!

15:06.850 --> 15:08.930
You’ll leave really soon.

15:09.580 --> 15:10.720
Kanon-chan!

15:18.660 --> 15:20.600
Kanon-chan...

15:40.110 --> 15:42.840
Why do you always say you have evil aura?

15:45.780 --> 15:49.170
If you’re like that, you can’t be the Priestess of the Sky!

15:50.270 --> 15:52.160
I never wanted to become that.

15:52.160 --> 15:53.620
What are you saying?

15:56.620 --> 15:57.910
Then, switch!

15:57.910 --> 15:59.560
I’ll do it!

16:00.370 --> 16:01.690
I will...

16:04.510 --> 16:06.480
Even if I want to,

16:07.370 --> 16:08.690
I still can’t.

16:16.470 --> 16:20.910
I want to beat Sedona with my sister

16:20.910 --> 16:23.640
and go back to the ocean!

16:24.130 --> 16:28.050
But because I don’t have the power to be a Priestess...

16:29.250 --> 16:31.470
Why can’t it be me?

16:32.340 --> 16:35.800
Why is it a Sky person like you?

16:42.030 --> 16:44.410
Found an evil soul.

16:48.190 --> 16:50.650
Stop it!

16:50.650 --> 16:52.730
Let me go! Stop it!

16:56.250 --> 16:58.740
No!

17:11.350 --> 17:14.840
Seems that you will interfere.

17:15.750 --> 17:16.970
I...

17:23.130 --> 17:24.270
Onee-chan!

17:25.730 --> 17:27.380
Urin! Hide!

17:30.730 --> 17:32.150
Wait... Gross...

17:32.150 --> 17:35.730
O light of the clear ocean, do as I command! Shine over the darkness!

17:43.060 --> 17:44.830
Thanks.

17:45.120 --> 17:47.270
Kanon-chan, hurry up and escape.

17:47.270 --> 17:48.260
But...

17:48.260 --> 17:51.250
I’ll be okay on my own.

17:52.710 --> 17:56.800
Those interfering with Sedona, disappear!

18:18.240 --> 18:19.240
It’s none of my business.

18:22.160 --> 18:25.580
I’ll never do something I don’t want to do ever again.

18:32.510 --> 18:33.240
That kind...

18:37.160 --> 18:38.470
...of stupid-looking thing...

18:41.720 --> 18:44.020
I’m not doing it because I like it.

18:45.800 --> 18:51.480
I guess Miyamori doesn’t like arguing or seeing others’ tension.

18:51.480 --> 18:53.140
I’m not like that.

18:53.140 --> 18:55.450
Kanon-chan is so kind.

18:55.450 --> 18:57.290
I am not kind at all!

18:58.530 --> 19:00.560
The evil aura was always there.

19:00.560 --> 19:02.880
The jobs got done nicely, though.

19:02.880 --> 19:06.190
That’s because I don’t want to be hated.

19:06.760 --> 19:09.870
Why does the explanation seem so nice?

19:19.570 --> 19:22.230
All right already! I’ll do it!

19:22.230 --> 19:24.290
It’s not a role that I want, but I will do it!

19:24.290 --> 19:26.220
I want a friend!

19:26.740 --> 19:28.080
Whatever it may be, even becoming a Priestess,

19:28.080 --> 19:29.640
I’ll just do it!

19:47.070 --> 19:48.290
Kanon-chan!

19:53.500 --> 19:55.590
Oh! The Priestess of the Sky!

19:58.050 --> 19:59.210
Turtle, fire!

20:02.920 --> 20:06.240
O light of pure sky, do as I command! Shine over the darkness!

20:10.160 --> 20:10.810
Watch out!

20:18.910 --> 20:20.280
Are you all right?

20:20.280 --> 20:22.700
Hang in there!

20:26.420 --> 20:28.090
It’s all right now.

20:28.090 --> 20:29.580
Go back into the ocean.

21:08.280 --> 21:10.070
Miyamori, what’s the matter?

21:10.070 --> 21:11.370
This is unusual.

21:11.700 --> 21:13.660
This is a coupon for a fortunetelling.

21:14.100 --> 21:16.170
Compared to my mom, I’m more accurate.

21:16.170 --> 21:17.760
Come over when I’m there.

21:17.760 --> 21:19.020
U-Um...

21:19.020 --> 21:21.340
Miyamori, you want to be a fortuneteller?

21:21.340 --> 21:22.660
I don’t know.

21:22.660 --> 21:26.750
After I thought about it, I don’t really want to go to college.

21:26.750 --> 21:30.270
Anyway, I’m going to try to reach 100% purity first.

21:33.030 --> 21:34.290
See ya.

21:34.290 --> 21:35.530
Thank you.

21:42.080 --> 21:44.500
This is slowly moving toward purity?

21:45.710 --> 21:47.360
You cannot let down your guard.

21:48.320 --> 21:52.060
Kanon-chan! I love you!

21:59.000 --> 22:00.320
Jeez...

22:26.650 --> 22:31.570
hikari no yurikago

22:26.650 --> 22:31.570
Within a droplet of water,

22:31.990 --> 22:35.120
shizuku no naka ni

22:31.990 --> 22:35.120
a cradle of light

22:35.450 --> 22:38.370
tojikometara

22:35.450 --> 22:38.370
is trapped.

22:38.370 --> 22:43.550
mizu no iro ni naru

22:38.370 --> 22:43.550
And so, it colors the water.

22:43.960 --> 22:47.170
mimi wo sumashite

22:43.960 --> 22:47.170
Clear your ears

22:47.170 --> 22:49.840
eien e

22:47.170 --> 22:49.760
to eternity.

22:49.840 --> 22:55.140
hitori de yume no ato

22:49.930 --> 22:55.140
Beyond a lonely dream,

22:55.140 --> 23:00.480
tsunaide yukeba

22:55.140 --> 23:00.480
if one connects with another,

23:01.190 --> 23:07.070
sotto kurikaesu kagayaki

23:01.190 --> 23:07.070
the repeating, soft shine

23:07.490 --> 23:12.120
warattemo attete

23:07.490 --> 23:12.120
meets and smiles,

23:12.120 --> 23:19.290
mou sukoshide kokoro ga todoku kara

23:12.120 --> 23:19.290
and with just a little more, the hearts have been reached.

23:19.290 --> 23:24.000
toumeina inori de

23:19.290 --> 23:23.880
With a transparent prayer,

23:24.000 --> 23:33.340
yasashiikuchikamu wo tsutsumuyo

23:24.000 --> 23:33.340
concealed within a gentle mouth.

23:36.100 --> 23:36.980
Did you know?

23:36.980 --> 23:38.300
Uncle is performing a secret ritual!

23:38.300 --> 23:39.270
How am I supposed to know?

23:39.270 --> 23:40.890
Use your beard to taste it.

23:40.890 --> 23:42.260
It seems like it’s digging a hole.

23:42.260 --> 23:43.690
Um, what?

23:43.690 --> 23:45.490
Next time, episode 4:

23:45.110 --> 23:49.990
Trial for One's Heart

23:47.170 --> 23:49.970
I love everyone!
